## 4. Would merging this branch into main conflict?
$ git merge-tree --write-tree main HEAD   # resulting tree, or conflict report
ecb0e917073b9513d962688ae12ec52f95664c28
exit=0
$ git rev-parse HEAD^{tree}   # compare with the line above
ecb0e917073b9513d962688ae12ec52f95664c28

The merge result equals this branch's tree exactly, with no conflict, because main's tree
is a8ac787b's tree and a8ac787b is an ancestor of HEAD. It cannot fast-forward (main is not
an ancestor of HEAD), so it needs a merge commit, but there is nothing to resolve.

## 5. Status, stated as 006 requires
This is an OWNER INTEGRATION FACT, not an acceptance claim. K1.1-reference-01 is
WAITING_FOR_REVIEW; no part of this log changes that. The kernel code on this branch is
H5, independently accepted by review-08. The kernel code on main is not.
